<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Feliz Cumple Noe</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #ffeef2;
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 50px;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #d63384;
      font-size: 2.5em;
    }
    .button {
      margin-top: 30px;
      background-color: #d63384;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      font-size: 1em;
      border-radius: 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background-color: #c2185b;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Feliz Cumple, Noe</h1>
  <p>Te hice esta sorpresa con mucho cariño.</p>

  <button class="button" onclick="document.getElementById('audio').play()">Reproducir canción</button>
  <audio id="audio" src="Solcito-Miguel-Bueno.mp3"></audio>
</body>
</html>
